# Candidate spanning rows and reversible combination certificates

The tables specify canonical-layer spans in the original 112-dimensional
coordinates. `LayerCertificates` checks their forward and reverse relations;
`Layers` identifies the spans with the canonical native commutator layers.
The numerical ranks are not used as assumptions.
